ce":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Clannad is set in a high-school located in some Japanese town. Okazaki Tomoya is a third-year student who doesn't take his studies seriously. Always late for class, he's seen as a delinquent by the rest of his classmates who are busy preparing for their entrance examinations. Needless to say, he hasn't too many close friends either.\n\nTomoya seems not to mind too - until one day he meets a girl, Furukawa Nagisa, who is left alone without friends on this school, because everybody she knew already graduated. What a clumsy girl, he thinks at first. But he can't leave her alone and so, while helping her, he meets a few other girls from his school. Although he doesn't care much about them at first, he soon opens his heart to them as they get to know each other better.\n\n(Source: AniDB)"},"tags":[{"name":"School","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rehabilitation","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Acting","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":70,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":68,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Baseball","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Clannad: The Motion Picture","english":"Clannad: The Motion Picture","native":"劇場版 クラナド","romaji":"Clannad Movie","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"劇場版 CLANNAD"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"剧场版 CLANNAD"}]},"trailer":{"id":"_bDkwezvFbE","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_bDkwezvFbE/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}